Unreleased — unified checking interface

  Breaking: check init/trans/reachable/invariant/progress replaces all old
  checking commands and operation names. BMC and induction share -depth;
  interpolation is the unbounded default for reachable/invariant checks.
  Typed interactive settings provide persistent timeout, execution-mode and
  progress-state defaults.
  Legacy reach-direction command-line switches are removed; select -method.
